WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.910
Le vidiyo ikhombisa ukuthi kwenziwa kanjani

2
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.580
ukuhlolwa kwangaphambi kweso kusetshenziswa ingaphambili

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.957
iluphu yesibili yedivayisi ye-Arclight.

4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Qala ngokuhlanzeka kwezandla futhi uzethule.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Qinisekisa

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
ubunikazi besiguli, chaza ukuhlolwa futhi uthole imvume yokukwenza.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Okokuqala thatha

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
imizuzwana embalwa ukubona womabili amehlo ngesikhathi esisodwa.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Bheka i-periorbitor, amajwabu amehlo kanye

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
amehlo, ukuphawula nganoma yikuphi ukuvuvukala, ububomvu nokuphuma, kanye nokuvelela kwamehlo

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
noma indawo yejwabu leso elingavamile.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Bese wenza ukuhlola okukhulisiwe usebenzisa ukukhanya kwe-arc.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Khanyisa ukukhanya okumhlophe bese ubamba idivayisi eduze kweso lakho.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Asondele kancane kwelesiguli

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
iso langakwesokudla kuqala lize ligxile.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Lokhu kuzoba cishe ku-6 cm.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Cela isiguli ukuthi

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
hambisa amehlo abo ngaphandle nangaphakathi, bese phezulu naphansi, kuyilapho bebambe izinkophe zabo ngobumnene,

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
ukuqaphela ngokuhlelekile isigcawu sesakhiwo esihlukile, ukucabanga ngabo ngamaqembu.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Okokuqala

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Leli qembu lihlanganisa ama-eyelashes aphezulu naphansi kanye namamajini e-lid, elesibili lihlanganisa i-conjunctiva.

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
kanye ne-sclera, kanye ne-forenax engezansi.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Iqembu lesithathu yi-cornea, ukuhlangana kwalokhu ne-sclera ebizwa

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
imilenze, futhi

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
inhlamvu yeso, ezungezwe iris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Uma usuqedile ukuphawula zonke lezi zakhiwo, qhubekela phambili ekuhloleni ukujula kwekamelo langaphambili.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
Igumbi langaphambili liyisikhala phakathi kwe-cornea ne-iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Ngokukhanyisa ukukhanya okuvela ohlangothini lwesikhashana, ukujula kwekamelo langaphambili

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
ingahlolwa.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Isithunzi ku-iris yamakhala singaphakamisa ikamelo langaphambili elingashoni.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Lokhu ukuhlola okuvamile okungenathunzi.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Manje khetha ukukhanya okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka kusibani se-arc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Ngodayi we-fluorescing ifilimu yezinyembezi, izindawo zokulahlekelwa kwe-epithelial kanye nezifo zizogqanyiswa.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Udayi ukhanya ngokukhanya okuluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
umdwebo indawo kanye nobukhulu bezindawo zokulahlekelwa kwe-epithelial nesifo.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Iqedile ngokuhlola ipuleti le-tarsal eliphakeme, beka ihlumela likakotini esivalweni esingaphezulu,

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
bese uphakamisa ngobumnene imivimbo uye phezulu ngenkathi ucindezela kancane ubheke phansi ngehlumela.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Ekuqaleni ibhekwa ngeso lenyama, bese uletha ukukhanya kwe-arc ukuze kubonakale kukhulisiwe.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Phinda lokhu kuhlola kwelinye iso.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Ngemva kwalokho, bonga isiguli, ufingqa amarekhodi okutholakele bese uphinda ukuhlanzeka kwezandla.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Sicela ubheke amanye amavidiyo wethu wephrojekthi ye-University of St Andrews Arc Light.
